"Sales, orders, profit and customer figures use your full WooCommerce order "
"history."
msgstr ""
"Las cifras de ventas, pedidos, beneficio y clientes usan todo tu historial "
"de pedidos de WooCommerce."

#. translators: %s: date BrikPanel was activated.
#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:560
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Visitors, conversion rate and the funnel are measured by BrikPanel from %s, "
"the day it was activated, so they have no earlier history."
msgstr ""
"Los visitantes, la tasa de conversión y el embudo los mide BrikPanel desde "
"el %s, el día en que se activó, por lo que no tienen historial anterior."

#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:564
