#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:793
msgid ""
"An AI assistant and email marketing engine for WooCommerce. It will chase "
"carts like these for you: a reminder first, a coupon only if that is not "
"enough. Join the private beta list to try it first."
msgstr ""
"Un asistente de IA y un motor de email marketing para WooCommerce. "
"Perseguirá carritos como estos por ti: primero un recordatorio y un cupón "
"solo si eso no basta. Apúntate a la lista de beta privada para probarlo "
"antes que nadie."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:800
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:802
msgid ""
"An AI assistant and email marketing engine for WooCommerce. It will follow "
"up after each completed order and win back the buyers who drift away, so "
"lifetime value keeps growing. Join the private beta list to try it first."
msgstr ""
"Un asistente de IA y un motor de email marketing para WooCommerce. Hará "
"seguimiento después de cada pedido completado y recuperará a los compradores "
"que se alejan, para que el valor de vida siga creciendo. Apúntate a la lista "
"de beta privada para probarlo antes que nadie."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:803
