"An AI assistant and email marketing engine for WooCommerce. It will read "
"these segments straight from BrikPanel and re-engage the ones you pick. Join "
"the private beta list to try it first."
msgstr ""
"Un asistente de IA y un motor de email marketing para WooCommerce. Leerá "
"estos segmentos directamente desde BrikPanel y volverá a captar a los que "
"elijas. Apúntate a la lista de beta privada para probarlo antes que nadie."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:804
msgid ""
"An AI assistant and email marketing engine for WooCommerce. It will scan "
"your customers daily and start a win-back series for anyone who has not "
"ordered in months. Join the private beta list to try it first."
