#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-whatsapp.php:198
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_first_name}, this is {site_title} about your order "
"{order_number}. Its current status is {order_status}."
msgstr ""
"Hola {customer_first_name}, te escribo de {site_title} sobre tu pedido "
"{order_number}. Su estado actual es {order_status}."

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-whatsapp.php:876
msgid ""
"WhatsApp opens with this text already typed in, so you only have to press "
"send - nothing goes out on its own. Write it in any language, and use line "
"breaks freely. {order_items} lists every product on its own line, so give it "
"a line of its own. Clear this field to go back to opening an empty "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp se abre con este texto ya escrito, así que solo tienes que pulsar "
"enviar: nada sale por su cuenta. Escríbelo en cualquier idioma y usa saltos "
"de línea con libertad. {order_items} lista cada producto en su propia línea, "
"así que dale una línea propia. Vacía este campo para volver a abrir una "
"conversación vacía."

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-whatsapp.php:915
msgid "Current status name"
msgstr "Nombre del estado actual"

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-whatsapp.php:918
